                                <li>
                                    <strong>Take short underneath passes against zone coverage:</strong> Tight ends and slot receivers running out routes provide consistent four to six yard gains with minimal turnover risk.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <strong>Save coaching credits for key recruiting cycles:</strong> Bank credits during rebuilding years so you can recruit elite prospects when your roster is ready to compete for titles.
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <strong>Manage the game clock late in halves:</strong> Run the ball between the tackles to burn timeouts and leave opposing offenses with no time on the scoreboard.
                                </li>
